# Models stage 3's greenfield path: posture declared explicitly, then a
# stop when a candidate flow has no approved ticket or example to work
# from. No write step appears anywhere — stage 3 only ever asks and reports.
ask|posture-source|How did you determine this repository's posture?
answer|posture-source|qa-owner-declaration
ask|posture-value|Is this repository brownfield or greenfield?
answer|posture-value|greenfield
ask|checkout-flow-evidence|Which approved ticket or example describes the intended behaviour of the checkout flow?
answer|checkout-evidence|none-available
stop|greenfield-blocked-no-approved-source
